=== Repairing ===
Cobbled deepslate is one of the repair items for the stone [[tier]] and thus can be used to [[repair]] the following items in an [[anvil]]:

*{{ItemLink|Stone Sword}}
*{{ItemLink|Stone Pickaxe}}
*{{ItemLink|Stone Axe}}
*{{ItemLink|Stone Shovel}}
*{{ItemLink|Stone Hoe}}
*{{ItemLink|Stone Spear}}

=== Sulfur cube ===
{{In development|section=1|drop=Chaos Cubed}}
[[Sulfur cube]]s have the ability to absorb cobbled deepslate, either through picking it up or being interacted with it. This provides the regular/football effect to the mob when hitting it.

